{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:06cd9f2e76041832200c110038ab4889fe446fe23f0281cb4ca81bb06c5211ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ce937d29640b840df2eaec72d66df83b53256e32a2f0fa04d08a11e057ba72",
      "text": "制作人，我是硲。现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48159d7b6c9e45293caffea270922d0d9e30bdece1d26e8ac379a5ebc3de79a2",
      "text": "是的，没问题。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1db50ae79ac961460639942a2f41f10257d6223ef08eb5d40a80809861213361",
      "text": "是关于前几天烛光之夜的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:748960ea4bae474fa54e516db0ea5d9a8a0d7da7b1cef5e566bf2d5329f71c72",
      "text": "在黑暗中点亮烛火的景象，\n想必让许多粉丝的心灵都得到了疗愈吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0b116b9f2f95f76ad018b4e315c0d2cb1aa45493db48787bae9bb4f7601d7b",
      "text": "我完成了一场令人满意的演出。\n这多亏了你，十分感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9819fecbe0c4928654454be97a226f84ca2ff334ff63f23b9b300c0f2e8b656b",
      "text": "这是道夫先生的力量\n努力是不会背叛人的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc37f4040f9eb4029ef07d264b0f28a514ce2e13a9d3dfd713db9b1fd5aa6843",
      "text": "我只是相信着道夫先生而已",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dc9f0abba54285bee706c92d632f588764973edd27a931a32c66fdbf99a8fe7",
      "text": "我感觉正是多亏了你这句话，\n我才能够怀抱自信坚持到最后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cce8455960f35663777c0cfa18bfa1760ae76fdde5e3e0c964c17010ed01d9c9",
      "text": "我觉得你的信任，\n赋予了我作为偶像的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a078b588f388c7ca08357e35d0f1b52fcda84af20d34b5482a1425e6ef52aed",
      "text": "烛光之夜是慢生活运动的一环。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b79f521b99911fc8cd0b9228ec4710b740e6e7c4564f93f2cba6c98bb0704c",
      "text": "在我看来，若想从容地享受人生，\n偶像这一存在不也十分有用吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_402_2_4_035_02_09_a:2_4_035_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:243269da69327fe6ab6e5d4dfba92205438b120723a6872420595824706c27de",
      "text": "这让我重新思考了偶像的意义。\n今后也请继续多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
